      "rationale": "NBER quarterly peak 2019Q4 and trough 2020Q2; monthly peak February 2020 and trough April 2020. These are quarterly study windows, not daily shock endpoints. https://www.nber.org/research/data/us-business-cycle-expansions-and-contractions",
